   *Default*: 1000
 
+----------------------------------
+``<max_generation_tracks>`` Element
+----------------------------------
+
+The ``<max_generation_tracks>`` element sets the maximum number of tracks in
+one secondary generation. When the next generation is larger than this, those
+tracks are discarded and no later secondary generation is transported. Tracks
+already completed in the fission generation are kept. Zero disables the limit.
+
+  *Default*: 0
+
 -----------------------------
 ``<max_secondaries>`` Element
 -----------------------------
